        "fixHint": "Remove `transform: translate(-50%,-50%) rotate(-8deg) scale(0)` from CSS and replace with GSAP properties: xPercent: -50, yPercent: -50, scale: 0. Example: tl.fromTo('#stamp', { xPercent: -50, yPercent: -50, scale: 0 }, { xPercent: -50, yPercent: -50, scale: 0, ...yourAnimation }). tl.fromTo is exempt from this rule."
      },
